    "champion.9038.trigger.71.name": "Radiant Crown",
    "champion.9038.trigger.71.desc": "Each time his team loses another 25% of its health (a Helios Rally), Aureon gains 30 Mana.",
    "champion.9040.name": "Rivet",
    "champion.9040.title": "The Shredder",
    "champion.9040.ability.name": "Shred Volley",
    "champion.9040.ability.desc": "Sprays shredding rounds at the target and the enemies next to it: 135/200/315 (+75% AD) physical damage, and their Armor and Magic Resist are reduced by 30% for 4 s.",
    "champion.9045.name": "Hexa",
    "champion.9045.title": "The Walking Equation",
    "champion.9045.desc": "The ally on the hex directly behind Hexa climbs in at the start of combat: Hexa gains 80% of its max Health and a bonus by its class (Bastion / Protector: 20/30/40% Omnivamp; Bruiser / Duelist: 20/30/40% Attack Damage; Marksman / Gunslinger: 12/20/30% Damage Amp; Sorcerer / Mystic: 2/4/5 Mana per second; Assassin: 40/70/100% Critical Strike Chance). When Hexa falls, the pilot ejects. Its attacks fire a barrage of 4 bullets.",
    "champion.9045.ability.name": "Overdrive",
    "champion.9045.ability.desc": "Gains a 300/400/5000 (+10% max HP) shield and channels for 4 s: every second a laser hits the target for 210/315/1550 physical damage and the enemies up to 3 hexes behind it for 30% of that, while 4 missiles a second hit random enemies for 13/20/95.",
    "champion.9046.name": "Moss",
