    "trait.7.tagline": "The Cosmic Link. Star dust: after a lost combat gain 20 + 5 x your loss streak, and 2 per Najmi takedown. At every 100 star dust (up to 600) the Najmi offer a cash-out that grows with the bank: take it, or keep saving for a bigger one.",
    "trait.7.bp2": "Collect star dust. When a Najmi unit casts, adjacent allies gain 15 Mana.",
